026-10-03T14:15:04+08:00", "level": "INFO", "source": "heartbeat", "message": "心跳已送(ok)"}, {"id": 5037, "ts": "2026-10-03T14:15:04+08:00", "level": "INFO", "source": "engine", "message": "EOD 完成:更新 9 檔資料,記錄 0 筆預測,兌現 0 筆。"}, {"id": 5038, "ts": "2026-10-03T14:15:47+08:00", "level": "INFO", "source": "ai", "message": "AI 呼叫已恢復(登入有效)。"}, {"id": 5039, "ts": "2026-10-03T14:15:47+08:00", "level": "INFO", "source": "ai", "message": "AI 收盤日報已產生,可在儀表板查看。"}], "last_id": 5039}